      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, Section 314(b), of the Public Health Service Act (42 U. S. C. A. \u00a7246 (b) as amended by P. L. 89-749 and P. L. 90-174 (hereinafter referred to as \"Comprehensive Health Planning Act\") calls for promoting and assuring the highest level of health attainable for every person in an environment which contributes positively to healthful individual and family living, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2707,
          "min": -1.4296
